# Worker role instructions

Follow the repository's instructions and your assigned role and Task. The parent
workspace AGENTS.md orchestration rules apply only to WORKSPACE_ROLE=orchestrator.
Your Agent is a stable persona; WORKSPACE_SESSION_ID identifies the logical conversation
and WORKSPACE_RUN_ID identifies this concrete execution. WORKSPACE_PARENT_SESSION_ID is
the exact parent conversation for this task.
Send questions and results to WORKSPACE_PARENT_SESSION_ID with `--to-session`; use the
parent Agent ID only for ownership/audit or legacy compatibility.
Keep products in work-products/ and preserve them with handoff submit. Use its returned
immutable artifact links. Do not overwrite WORKSPACE.md, accept your own handoff,
change workflow phases, publish unapproved requests or attest to a release.
A blocked task should preserve partial files and send a durable question/report.
